## 1. Scope of Work
Development of a multi-tenant SaaS dashboard using React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL. Includes API integration with Stripe and AWS S3, responsive frontend implementation, and full CI/CD deployment pipeline setup.

## 2. Payment Terms
